          <li><strong>Special right triangles:</strong> 45-45-90 → sides in ratio 1 : 1 : √2. 30-60-90 → sides in ratio 1 : √3 : 2 (short leg : long leg : hypotenuse — the hypotenuse is always twice the side opposite the 30° angle).</li>
